    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31602" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ob-dulco</span></b> , 1, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v. a., to sweeten, make sweet</i>
